-- Experiment 190 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, App. D Problem 15 (FriCAS column).
-- A 2-D parabolic PDE integrated to blow-up; FriCAS has no PDE solver (and no
-- stiff ODE integrator), so both rows are SKIP.  See blowup_time.m.
)read ../siam100_common.input )quiet
vskip("d15.machine", "NDSolve (PDE)")
vskip("d15.wp50", "NDSolve (PDE)")
)quit
